_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"MAH43Xo-uTKs99Ieg-Qg7A","review_id":"kqZ6DWxucqIleyddRaI0xA","date":"2015-10-02T18:08:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9336017370223999,"text_excerpt":"The last time I went to this ice cream place I was extremely disappointed in the lack of flavors and the small portion sizes. However, they must have come under new management in the last two years, as I really enjoyed my last visit! When we walked in the workers gave us two LARGE samples each of cafe au lait and a peach cream flavor. They were both great, and on top of them we ordered a cookies and cream and a dark chocolate. The dark chocolate was especially amazing, and tasted like a rich frozen pudding. We didn't even finish the large portions. Love the changes, Kream! We'll definitely be back."},{"business_id":"MAH43Xo-uTKs99Ieg-Qg7A","review_id":"JpuObcZ22-iCifzrOKWjyw","date":"2016-07-10T23:47:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9334768056869507,"text_excerpt":"Awesome ice cream shop. Locally owned! Please check them out if you have a chance. Great area in the city. Try a new flavor. All of them are really good."},{"business_id":"MAH43Xo-uTKs99Ieg-Qg7A","review_id":"yOX1lBeROu0xYuX8NgtTaA","date":"2017-02-05T22:45:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9300735592842102,"text_excerpt":"I ate here a few months back. I really liked this place. It is small in size with limited options, but there is one really great ice cream flavor and why I gave it 5 stars. Its called Not So Vanilla. It is an alcohol infused vanilla ice cream and they put that in between two chocolate chip cookies! omg!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
